  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "f2d6c0c2-ce96-4898-a325-cab377e13f9d"],
 "-th vertex over the base vertex ",
 Cell[BoxData["p"], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "9b291d15-8299-4394-82cc-7c8b3562e7f7"],
 ". Structural evaluation stores no drawing coordinates; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InfraFiberedGraphHighlight"]], 
    "paclet:WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry/ref/InfraFiberedGraphHighlight", 
    "WolframInstitute/InfraGeometry Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "396f0e76-3f5a-4c5a-8fb3-845832cbd4c0"],
 " arranges its fibers over the base."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9c9c538d-8306-4f78-81b8-8f4b5482c588"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["size", "TI"],
 " may also be a raw size of the base: the length of a cycle, the dimensions \
of a grid or a torus, the cell area of a sphere mesh."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"e9612b75-b79f-409b-bfd7-c1ccc66fa514"]
